rclone (FULL_VERSION) stable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release, packaged from the official upstream linux release
    archive published at https://github.com/rclone/rclone/releases
  * Contains the rclone binary, the rclone.1 manual page, the
    /usr/sbin/mount.rclone helper symlink and bash, zsh and fish completions.
  * The upstream changelog is published at https://rclone.org/changelog/

